  "summary": "Anima is an open-source Agent OS for intelligent hardware: a Python/FastAPI backend with a LangGraph Brain, device Skills, layered file-based memory, MIoT adapters, and a React polling dashboard, currently supporting Xiaomi/Mi Home devices. AGENT.md and ARCHITECTURE_GUARDRAILS.md provide contributor-facing architecture and testing guidance. Evidence coverage: 166 of 400 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
